Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.97,0:02:03.98,OP,chptr,0,0,0,,{Episode}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.59,0:02:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Major...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.61,0:02:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd prefer to do this on the Ninth Floor.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.11,0:02:14.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The paperwork I do down here is menial,\Nbut that doesn't mean I can ignore it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.52,0:02:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Well?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.19,0:02:19.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Doctor Hanada has been missing since the incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.33,0:02:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,His maid was found murdered in an abandoned factory.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.47,0:02:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.09,0:02:29.63,Default,,2,2,0,,According to his seven-year-old daughter,\Nthe doctor turned into glowing ash and disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.03,0:02:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Glowing ash?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.49,0:02:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps this {\i1}isn't{\i0} something we should talk about here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.88,0:02:38.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It seems that people from\NV Shipping were there as well— {would a hyphen make sense here?}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.13,0:02:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, right, I heard that you made contact with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.56,0:02:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.17,0:02:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think it's them?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.78,0:02:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.13,0:02:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's evident that they're deeply involved in the incident,
