Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.36,0:02:54.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Alma Company? {Website has "Alma Trading Company" but the signature says "Alma Company" so I'm ignoring it.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.02,0:03:00.19,Default,,0,0,53,,Here we'll call {\fs90\bord3\fnHoefler Text}x{\r}-squared plus {\fs90\bord3\fnHoefler Text}y{\r}-squared {\fs90\bord3\fnHoefler Text}t{\r},
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.19,0:03:02.37,Default,,0,0,53,,and we'll say {\fs90\bord3\fnHoefler Text}x + y = s{\r}.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.94,0:03:05.82,Default,,0,0,0,,If we put this into the equation we just looked at,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.82,0:03:08.17,Default,,0,0,53,,we find that {\fs90\bord3\fnHoefler Text}t{\r} plus {\fs90\bord3\fnHoefler Text}x{\r} equals 6.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.17,0:03:11.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I get goosebumps just remembering it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.10,0:03:14.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who was Yuliy fighting back there...{meh. the problem is that this line can easily be read to be an awkward stand-along line, which is bad. So if it's to be read as a stand-alone line, it may as well have the right meaning.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.73,0:03:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Or rather, {\i0}what{\i1} was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.09,0:03:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}If we set {\fs90\bord3\fnHoefler Text}st{\r} to equal 5, then 4 must...{id really know what to do with the variables. They just look weird renderend normally. Oh, I know, different font.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.83,0:03:28.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Love, I'd say.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.10,0:03:31.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Makie{**-san}? Shino{**-san}?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.03,0:03:33.40,Default,,0,0,0,,That sigh was the sign of a lovesick young girl!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.40,0:03:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,What? N-No it wasn't!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.89,0:03:37.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not... I mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.97,0:03:44.58,Default,,0,0,0,,She's {\i1}definitely{\i0} lovesick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.34,0:04:03.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You wouldn't think you'd find a district so calm in an imperial capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.23,0:04:04.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.99,0:04:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I found out what they're doing with Saki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.85,0:04:10.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Some of her relatives are taking her in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.98,0:04:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure she'll be fine in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.72,0:04:15.73,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.29,0:04:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Her precious family—her beloved father—was murdered.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.10,0:04:28.03,Default,,0,0,0,,There was nothing else we could do.\NYou made the right call.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.63,0:04:31.25,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had been the one—{It's not entirely clear what he was going to say here so I'm phrasing it like this.}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.25,0:04:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're acting pretty strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.35,0:04:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the one who's acting strange!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:41.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You're throwing me off!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:42.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.30,0:04:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\clip(950,915,1140,1056)}Idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Her precious family...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.71,0:05:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Too bad, Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.49,0:05:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just another second and I would have taken him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.45,0:05:29.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then, I would have been the one pulling it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.62,0:05:31.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If only I hadn't sneezed...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.57,0:05:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You really don't handle the cold well, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.49,0:05:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You should use this guy to make some new clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.10,0:05:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You got him, so he's not mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.87,0:05:44.17,Default,,0,0,0,,How about we tell everyone that you did, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.63,0:05:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.28,0:05:46.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Nope!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.70,0:05:49.59,Default,,0,0,0,,If you're angry, try getting the next one before I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.59,0:05:51.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Come {\i1}on{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:53.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.30,0:06:03.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It's huge!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.41,0:06:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,This will provide us with all the meat and tools we need for a while!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.95,0:06:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll have a party at the Elder's house tonight!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.90,0:06:12.61,Default,,0,0,0,,A feast? We're having a feast at Gustav's house?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.61,0:06:17.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey! How many times do I have to tell you all\Nthat my house isn't a banquet hall?{?}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.63,0:06:22.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy, call him the Elder, not Gustav.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.67,0:06:24.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.14,0:06:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big one. Which one of you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.91,0:06:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.78,0:06:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.16,0:06:33.37,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd assumed it was Mikhail.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.85,0:06:33.37,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.90,0:06:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Very impressive, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.53,0:06:37.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Especially at your age.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.68,0:06:42.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess tonight's party will be in your honor.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.19,0:06:44.96,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he's lying!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.96,0:06:47.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}My brother's{*Nii-san's} the one who got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.43,0:07:07.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That was the most fun I've had in a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.94,0:07:15.83,Default,,2,2,0,,On the other hand, it's sad to think that a grand feast for the whole race can now fit in this tiny hall.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.83,0:07:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Other then Mikhail and Yuliy,\Nthere are no longer any young among us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.59,0:07:25.70,Default,,0,0,0,,With the Ark of Sirius that our race was tasked with protecting no longer here,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.70,0:07:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,it would seem to be our fate to fade away with the passing of the times.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.85,0:07:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't there something else you should be saying?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.14,0:07:39.02,Default,TLC,2,2,0,,"It's too late for us, but you two youngsters should leave the village and learn more of the world!" Right?{yeah idk, but I at least think it's kind of a funny line now}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.45,0:07:43.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Just what I'd expect from Alexei's child.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.53,0:07:47.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, the elderly get so melancholy when they drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.43,0:07:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Did we lose the Ark of Sirius, Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.47,0:07:52.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you were awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.88,0:07:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,We haven't lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.31,0:07:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It just isn't here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.96,0:08:02.21,Default,,0,0,0,,One day we'll have to send you two to protect the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.21,0:08:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.55,0:08:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll be able to leave Dogville at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.32,0:08:10.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it? The next village over?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.08,0:08:12.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Someplace much further.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.15,0:08:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Mongolia?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.19,0:08:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even close. Way, way further.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.51,0:08:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it, then?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.41,0:08:21.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What would you do if you found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.28,0:08:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd protect it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.99,0:08:27.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd protect it, and protect Mom too!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.54,0:08:28.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.69,0:08:34.03,Default,,0,0,0,,While I'm at it, I'd protect my brother,\Nand Gustav, and everyone else in the—
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.94,0:08:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,What a dependable Sirius!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.42,0:08:45.81,Default,,0,0,0,,That always seems to happen at the most important part.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.81,0:08:48.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy can't handle the cold so well, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.48,0:08:52.84,Default,,0,0,0,,But guess what? I'm making the perfect present for my little summer boy.{the easily-gets cold Yuliy}{wow, that's actually inspired}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.65,0:08:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.08,0:08:57.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll find out when it's done.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.94,0:09:01.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on! What is it? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.31,0:09:03.27,Default,,0,0,0,,More like a dependable puppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.27,0:09:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark of Sirius.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.17,0:09:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,¡Hola, Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.35,0:09:32.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.69,0:09:34.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Are your wounds all healed up?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.33,0:09:36.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah. I'm fine now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.12,0:09:37.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.48,0:09:40.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh... I got your coat fixed for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.31,0:09:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.92,0:09:43.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Uhh...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.60,0:09:49.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if something happens, call me whenever!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.00,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Ciao!{The correct spelling of this would probably depend on what country she's from, which we don't know, so I'll just use the spelling that eng speakers would understand.}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.37,0:10:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.60,0:10:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna go get something to eat. You coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.39,0:10:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.59,0:10:08.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.74,0:10:11.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's get something another day, whenever you feel like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.38,0:10:13.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay. Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.36,0:10:25.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going out for a bit. Go ahead and eat withou—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.25,0:10:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, is it just you alone in here, Yuliy?{i don't think i get the joke}{Years late, the joke is that they're not all hanging out in that room because Yuliy's in there being down but not showing it, everyone comes in rapid succession to try to cheer him up but he turns them away, while still not showing it and giving them justification to come on harder, and Willard walks in like he's going to be the next one but then's like "Oh what, what's going on, why is it just you in here?"}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.42,0:10:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:31.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.94,0:10:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Doctor Hanada\Nwas a terrible shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.28,0:10:42.08,Default,,0,0,0,,And to Saki{**-chan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.67,0:10:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What the vampires did to my family in Dogville,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.56,0:10:49.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I've ended up doing to Saki{**-chan}.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.42,0:10:52.76,Default,,0,0,0,,And then there's...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.59,0:11:00.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"Even if the Ark draws you to it now, it's too late."
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:01.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.53,0:11:03.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what the Royal said before she died.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I think they may have come to Japan in search of the Ark.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.50,0:11:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy! Yuliy, are you awake?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.72,0:11:23.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}.{"Big Brother" is something of a juvenile title in my head, so it'll only be used during the flashbacks. If you disagree and think jsut Brother is better, tell me. I may have had my head warped by anime.}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.25,0:11:25.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.92,0:11:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.21,0:11:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.24,0:11:40.59,Default,,0,0,0,,A... monster?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.59,0:11:41.66,Default,,0,0,0,,A vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.71,0:11:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Vampire?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.11,0:11:54.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Blood! She won't stop bleeding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.19,0:11:59.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Misha...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.49,0:12:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Take Yuliy with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.98,0:12:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.60,0:12:12.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.75,0:12:16.63,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to treat Mom. If we don't, she'll die!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.63,0:12:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.83,0:12:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.34,0:12:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.11,0:12:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Live, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.30,0:12:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,My beloved...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.26,0:12:42.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yulechka... {This appears to be a girls name so either they didn't look into it enough or we're going to get a Punch Line style twist at some point. Probably the former.}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.25,0:12:47.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.19,0:12:50.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Mom. Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.47,0:12:51.68,Default,,0,0,0,,We're leaving, Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.68,0:12:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,No, we've got to take Mom with us!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.89,0:12:54.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.06,0:12:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You have to do what she told you to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.56,0:13:13.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a strong boy, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.45,0:13:28.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Dogville.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.33,0:13:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The land where our destiny will be forged.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.10,0:13:36.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And the land where the Sirius will meet their end.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.34,0:13:44.93,Default,,0,0,0,,For close to one thousand years, we vampires have ruled this world from the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.93,0:13:51.70,Default,,0,0,0,,And as the beings that will stand at the apex of this planet's ecosystem for the next thousand years,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,we have a duty to lead the foolish masses.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.83,0:13:59.29,Default,,0,0,0,,For that, we will need the Sirius' Ark.{"their arc" is confusing because of the previous line.}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.86,0:14:03.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that right, human?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.70,0:14:07.32,Default,,0,0,0,,The Ark...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,If I came here because I was drawn by the Ark,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'm sure my brother is here after it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.49,0:14:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.85,0:14:18.50,Default,,0,0,0,,While at Doctor Hanada's house,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.51,0:14:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I met my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.87,0:14:24.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.07,0:14:27.41,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to the Elder and everyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.86,0:14:28.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.49,0:14:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,But from the looks of it, we won't be able to go back to the village.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.51,0:14:33.77,Default,,0,0,0,,We can't stay here, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.85,0:14:37.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.75,0:14:39.52,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens, I'll protect you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.75,0:14:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.78,0:14:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.45,0:14:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, doesn't it seem too quiet?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.25,0:14:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.76,0:15:03.15,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're hunting, always pay attention when things get oddly quiet like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.69,0:15:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Remember that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.66,0:15:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.68,0:15:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, don't use guns.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.55,0:15:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,They dull your sense of smell.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.23,0:15:12.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.15,0:15:15.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.81,0:15:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't eat sweets before you go to bed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.87,0:15:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Those teeth you're so proud of will end up full of cavities.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.28,0:15:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.72,0:15:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,One last thing, Yuliy.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.95,0:15:26.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Live.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.42,0:15:47.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.07,0:15:55.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.72,0:15:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}—
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:15:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.28,0:16:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,He was practically unrecognizable.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.20,0:16:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,But his eyes, his scar, and the voice he called my name with...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.41,0:16:23.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Then it's possible that he made a blood pact with a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.39,0:16:29.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm completely disgusted with myself right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.35,0:16:36.53,Default,,1,1,0,,Even though I had just killed Doctor Hanada, inflicting\Non Saki{**-chan} the same pain that had been inflicted on me,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.01,0:16:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I was overcome with joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.30,0:16:44.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The moment I saw my brother,\NI was so happy that it hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.55,0:16:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even knowing that he may be a vampire.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.25,0:16:52.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Even though I swore to drive them to extinction,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.34,0:16:55.19,Default,,0,0,0,,my resolve now wavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.76,0:16:57.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I kill my brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.12,0:17:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,My brother, who became a vampire because he chose to protect me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.21,0:17:06.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I cut him down, like I cut down Doctor Hanada?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.80,0:17:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Professor, what...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.82,0:17:11.80,Default,,0,0,0,,What on earth should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.11,0:18:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}—
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.75,0:18:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.09,0:18:50.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you not scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.23,0:18:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.51,0:19:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.78,0:19:04.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.37,0:19:16.51,Default,,0,0,0,,This country gets cold too suddenly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}, I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.64,0:19:26.52,Default,,0,0,0,,When you were injured, I went to visit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.90,0:19:28.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When I did, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Then you should understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.32,0:19:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You're best off not getting any closer to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.15,0:19:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yuliy{**-san}—
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.11,0:19:39.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm a Jaeger.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.55,0:19:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's right. Didn't I decide long ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.89,0:20:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You're running through the bottle quickly tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.50,0:20:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.01,0:20:12.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I always do when I think about that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.28,0:20:16.82,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a windy day, just like today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.36,0:20:21.57,Default,,0,0,0,,On days like this, I always ask myself...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.42,0:20:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I have the right to say something like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.97,0:20:44.13,Default,,0,0,0,,If you don't at least drink some water, you'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.75,0:20:48.02,Default,,0,0,0,,If it'll let me meet Mom and\N{*}Big Brother{*Nii-san}, then I want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.30,0:20:54.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's what they would wish for you,\Nthen I'll let you do just that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.08,0:20:56.57,Default,,0,0,0,,But it isn't, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.62,0:21:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.35,0:21:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How am I supposed to live now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.33,0:21:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I might...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.21,0:21:26.49,Default,,0,0,0,,I might be able to teach you that.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.02,0:21:31.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{ED}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:44.91,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}What an unbearable end
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.21,0:21:42.22,ED,,0,0,0,,{OP lyrics start}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.91,0:21:51.53,ED,,0,0,0,,{\an7\blur0.75}I breath out, breath out, breath out, and stop
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.08,0:21:59.04,ED,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.75}As I'm fleeing from this cruel world, I fall into a deep sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.46,0:22:05.64,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}I hide behind the words "I'm doing my best"
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.64,0:22:11.43,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}But in the end I do nothing but look back
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.43,0:22:16.52,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Even when I feel like I've been able to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.52,0:22:21.73,ED,,0,0,0,,{\c&HA98B7B&\blur0.75}Eventually I realize that the only thing that's changed is the position of the stars
