Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.98,0:23:01.02,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Epilogue}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.16,0:23:09.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.12,0:23:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, {*}Lord Kershner{*Kershner-sama}, how unusual to see you down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.91,0:23:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Will you have it functioning?{How goes your work?}{This is the joke I mentioned. What he says is kind of literally translated as "How goes the head and tail of the thing?}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.45,0:23:16.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yes, take a look, it'll be functioning!{Swimmingly, as you can see!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.75,0:23:20.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll be functioning, punctioning, and junctioning!{He's all hooked up from his head to his tail!}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.07,0:23:22.13,Default,,0,0,0,,It won't actually junction with anything though.{Though he doesn't actually have a tail.}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.78,0:23:27.97,Default,,0,0,0,,In other words, it's finally done! Done!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.01,0:23:30.06,Default,chptr,0,0,0,,{Preview}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.48,0:23:33.33,Default,,0,0,0,,So what will we do about the Hyakko Party?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.89,0:23:34.68,Default-alt,,2,2,0,,The importation of weapons and military tech...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.33,0:23:36.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Before our Shouwa Restoration...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.68,0:23:36.20,Default-alt,,0,0,0,,I smell blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.20,0:23:40.02,Default,,2,2,0,,Alma Company looks forward to a fruitful business relationship.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.31,0:23:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,

